# MQ00 "Schatten und Licht": the player wakes in the Schattenrufmine (cells StartCelle, SchattenrufMinePart01 ..
# SchattenrufMinePart05), meets Celebro, loses him to the black cave troll, gets out with four torches and meets the
# archmage Merzul at the exit. Journal stages are TES4 numbers: 5 torch lit, 10 shock troll dead, 15 Celebro talked to,
# 20/25 Celebro02 killed, 27 first mine torch, 28 four torches, 29 black troll dead, 30 shaft below, 35 exit cave trigger,
# 45 Merzul's spell, 55 Merzul talked to, 60 music script.
# Placed refs without an EditorID (doors, levers, trigger zones, torches) are written as their TES4 FormID.
# Everything NPC-driven (Celebro, the trolls, Merzul) is only waited for. walk is the engine-pathed walk; moveto only stands in for the shaft fall;
# the troll and mage fights run with god mode on (set in 0000_chargen).

# MQ01PlayerTorchScript (on the player's own torch, Torch01Startcelle) sets stage 5 when it is equipped ("I should light
# the torch before going on"). MQ00CelebroScript then enables Celebro, MQ00ShocktrollScript moves the shock troll in,
# Celebro fights it, and 4 s after it dies the script sets stage 10. Celebro (not the player) kills the troll: it has
# 10 health. If he does not, this case fails and that is the bug.
case mq00_torch
console player.equipitem Torch01Startcelle
until 300 GetStage MQ00 >= 5
until 1800 GetStage MQ00 >= 10
expect MQ00ShockTroll.GetDead
end

# Celebro's stage-10 greeting ("Danke fuer das Licht"), then "Ihr habt auch einen Brief bekommen?" (MQ00Topic01) sets
# stage 15 and gives control back; Celebro's package then follows the player.
case mq00_celebro_talk
talk CelebroRef
ask "Ihr habt auch einen Brief bekommen?"
hear 300 CelebroRef Ja, habe ich
bye
until 300 GetStage MQ00 >= 15
end

# The start cave's way out is the lift. Step 1: the two special trolls (MQ00troll01Special) in the lift room attack
# the player and Celebro when the player enters the room's trigger zone (StartCelleAufzugRaumTriggerZone01, no
# EditorID). The wheel can only be put in after both are dead (StartCelleRotateXMinus03Script); the player kills them,
# kill stands in for the fight.
case mq00_lift_room_trolls
walk 001BFB71
wait 120
console StartCelleAufzugRaumTroll01Ref.kill
console StartCelleAufzugRaumTroll02Ref.kill
wait 30
expect GetDeadCount MQ00troll01Special >= 2
end

# Step 2: the player picks the gear wheel up off the floor (StartCelleZahnradAufnehmenScript sets the global Storyvar
# to 5) and sets it into the hole at the lift (StartCelleRotateXMinus03Script needs the player within 128 of
# StartCelleAufzugRadEinsetzenPosMarkerRef, sets Storyvar 6 and moves Celebro onto the lift). The hole is the enabled
# StartCelleAAZahnradGrobLoch01 ref, 001BFC33.
case mq00_gear_wheel
walk StartCelleRadAufnehmenHinweisRef
activate StartCelleRadAufnehmenHinweisRef
wait 30
expect GetGlobalValue Storyvar >= 5
walk StartCelleAufzugRadEinsetzenPosMarkerRef
activate 001BFC33
wait 60
expect GetGlobalValue Storyvar >= 6
end

# Step 3: player and Celebro both inside StartCelleAufzugTriggerZone01 and within 100 of each other sets Storyvar 7 and
# the lift rises 940 units over 15 s. The player stands in the zone; Celebro is already on the platform.
case mq00_lift_rides
walk StartCelleAufzugTriggerZone01Ref
until 600 GetGlobalValue Storyvar >= 7
wait 600
end

# The start cave's door 0000956F (CDoor00) leads to SchattenrufMinePart01.
case mq00_leave_start_cave
walk 0000956F
activate 0000956F
until 600 player.GetInCell SchattenrufMinePart01
end

# MQ00SchattenrufDoor01 (000011C6) carries MQ00CaveDoor01: opening it disables CelebroRef. In SchattenrufMinePart02 the
# NPC script MQ01CelebroDeadScript01 (on Celebro02) notices the player, speaks MQ00Cel03 and 3 s later sets stage 20
# (INFO 000011D3, Celebro02's greeting, sets 20 as well). 2.5 s after that the black troll is enabled and attacks
# Celebro02 behind the grate; his OnDeath sets stage 25 and gives control back.
case mq00_part02_celebro_dies
walk 000011C6
activate 000011C6
until 600 player.GetInCell SchattenrufMinePart02
until 1800 GetStageDone MQ00 20
until 1800 GetStageDone MQ00 25
expect Celebro2Ref.GetDead
end

# The gondola lever (SchattenrufHebelGondel, 001AB374, no EditorID) works only within 150 of GondelmarkerRef. The ride
# takes 45 s (SchattenrufGondelScript) and ends with SchattenrufGondelvar 10. The black troll breaks through its grate
# once the player is within 400 of SchattenrufAlptraumTrollFreiMarkerRef (right at the lever) and chases the player
# across the rope; god mode keeps the player alive.
case mq00_gondola
walk GondelmarkerRef
activate 001AB374
until 2400 GetGlobalValue SchattenrufGondelvar >= 10
end

# Door 00001236 (CDoor00) leads to SchattenrufMinePart03, the torch room.
case mq00_enter_part03
walk 00001236
activate 00001236
until 600 player.GetInCell SchattenrufMinePart03
end

# SchattenrufGitterTuerScript: the grate door stands open; once the player has walked past Gittermarker02Ref it shuts
# behind them (stage < 28). The first TorchSchattenruf in the inventory while MQ00 is at 25 sets stage 27 (MQ00Script);
# the fourth, with the grate shut, sets stage 28 and lets the grate be opened again. The four torches are placed refs
# without EditorIDs: 0022CE66, 001AB57C, 001AB57B, 001AB579. If a torch does not land in the inventory the case fails
# on the count.
case mq00_four_torches
walk Gittermarker02Ref
wait 90
take 0022CE66
until 300 GetStageDone MQ00 27
take 001AB57C
take 001AB57B
take 001AB579
until 300 GetStageDone MQ00 28
expect player.GetItemCount TorchSchattenruf == 4
end

# The player opens the grate again and sets a torch into each of the four posts
# (SchattenrufAlptraumTrollFackelPfosten0NScript removes one torch each and lights SchattenrufAlptraumTrollFackel0NRef).
# With all four lit the black troll flees and burns; 7 s later its script sets stage 29 ("Fallensteller" achievement).
case mq00_torch_posts
activate SchattenrufGitterTuer01Ref
walk SchattenrufAlptraumTrollFackelPfosten01Ref
activate SchattenrufAlptraumTrollFackelPfosten01Ref
wait 30
walk SchattenrufAlptraumTrollFackelPfosten02Ref
activate SchattenrufAlptraumTrollFackelPfosten02Ref
wait 30
walk SchattenrufAlptraumTrollFackelPfosten03Ref
activate SchattenrufAlptraumTrollFackelPfosten03Ref
wait 30
walk SchattenrufAlptraumTrollFackelPfosten04Ref
activate SchattenrufAlptraumTrollFackelPfosten04Ref
until 900 GetStageDone MQ00 29
expect SchattenrufAlptraumTroll01Ref.GetDead
end

# The key the troll swallowed (MQ00KeyGefressen) is in the troll's inventory; the harness cannot take an item out of
# a container, so the key is not exercised. SchattenrufMinePart03TrigBoxScript drops the player down the shaft with
# a MoveTo to SchattenrufMineSchachtEndeMarker, which is what the moveto repeats. MQ00Cavedoor02 (on the cave doors of
# SchattenrufMinePart04) sets stage 30 1.5 s after that cell loads.
case mq00_shaft_below
console player.moveto SchattenrufMineSchachtEndeMarker
until 600 GetStageDone MQ00 30
end

# Cave door 00001A03 (MQ00CaveDoor002) leads to SchattenrufMinePart05, the exit cave. Its trigger zone MQ00AusgangTrigger
# (ref 00001E99) sets stage 35 and wakes twelve cave trolls (MQ00TrollA01 .. A12), the fire wall and Merzul.
case mq00_exit_cave
walk 00001A03
activate 00001A03
until 600 player.GetInCell SchattenrufMinePart05
walk 00001E99
until 300 GetStageDone MQ00 35
end

# Merzul kills the trolls alone (his spell sets stage 45 through SpellMQ00Merzul01Script); when all twelve of
# MQ00troll01Ausgang are dead the trigger script disables the controls and Merzul force-greets the player. The case
# waits for the twelve deaths and the walk over, then the dialogue is already open (as in the Oblivion chargen cases).
case mq00_merzul_arrives
until 3600 GetDeadCount MQ00troll01Ausgang >= 12
expect GetStageDone MQ00 45
hear 1800 MQ00MerzulRef Der Magie zu Ehren
end

# MQ00Topic02 "Stammte dieser Brief von Euch?" (two INFOs split on GetPCInFaction, both set stage 55 and give the letter
# and the directions). Stage 55's result script starts MQ01Tate, joins NehrimOrdenFaction and disables the teleport
# marker; Merzul then casts his spell and vanishes (trigger script states 14 .. 17) and the controls return.
case mq00_merzul_letter
ask "Stammte dieser Brief von Euch?"
hear 300 MQ00MerzulRef mehr oder weniger
bye
until 300 GetStageDone MQ00 55
expect GetStageDone MQ01Tate 1
expect player.GetItemCount MQ00Brief >= 1
expect player.GetItemCount MQ00Wegbeschreibung >= 1
expect player.GetInFaction NehrimOrdenFaction
end

# MQ00ExploreMusic sets stage 60 once stage 55 is reached; the teleport marker is disabled by the stage-55 result.
case mq00_merzul_gone
wait 300
expect GetStageDone MQ00 60
expect MQ00MerzulTeleportMarkerRef.GetDisabled
end

# The exit door (MQ00Exitdoor01, 00007218) only opens once MQ00 >= 55 (MQ00ExitdoorScn) and leads out of the mine.
# The next chapter (MQ01Tate "Belagerung der Hexer", driven by NQ00Karick, then MQ01Porim and the hand-in at
# Hohepriester Aratornias that sets MQ00 65 and MQ01 5) is not drafted here: the mine wall stays shut until MQ01Tate
# stage 35.
case mq00_leave_mine
walk 00007218
activate 00007218
until 600 player.GetInCell SchattenrufMinePart05 == 0
end
